  "description": "Everything hurt. Who was he? What was he? He didn't remember ... couldn't remember. All that came to mind was the power running in his veins, the whispers in his mind. Kill, they said. Kill! His body moved with grace and ease, as if he had done it a million times before. What had he done? He tried to remember, tried to think. His fingers were wet with some kind of red liquid, warm, and runny. Red blended with red, until everything he saw was red. Danger! Enemy! His fingers moved anew and met soft flesh, shredding it to pieces before he realized what was going on. At the edges of his vision, purple flames began to spread.Maybe - just maybe - the voices would stop when he had killed everyone. It was worth a try.",
